/**
 * WhatsApp CTAs that open a pre-filled chat with the owner.
 * - WhatsAppButton: full-width button (demo end + pricing page).
 * - WhatsAppFab: subtle floating button shown throughout the demo so help is
 *   always one tap away without interrupting the flow.
 */
